# Source configuration example; do not source this into a running service.
# Choose a verified release containing the Unreleased all-projects implementation.
T3_CONNECTOR_OAUTH_PROJECTS=all
T3_CONNECTOR_CONFIG=/path/to/read-endpoints.json
T3_CONNECTOR_OAUTH_WRITE_CONFIG=/path/to/write-endpoints.json
# Both files must name the same aliases, environmentIds and logical destinations.
# Read token files remain read-only; write token files remain read+operate.
# Existing allowedProjects in read-endpoints.json are ignored only by OAuth/all.
# T3_CONNECTOR_OAUTH_WRITE_PROJECTS must be unset (a nonempty value fails boot).
# The service must retain its existing issuer, resource, state and listener settings.
# Upgrade Fleet's source launcher/preflight to the verified release before activation;
# 0.7.0/0.8.0 release artifacts do not include this Unreleased implementation.
